Q2Admin authors and contributors
================================

Everyone who has contributed to Q2Admin, listed alphabetically by gaming
alias.

claire          Current maintainer
Harven          Bug fixes
id Software     Quake 2 game API definitions (game.h, shared.h)
KillerBee       Original author
MDVz0r          Anti-cheat exception and hash lists
Niehztog        Bug and security fixes
Quadz           Bug and security fixes
QwazyWabbit     Bug and security fixes
r1ch            Bug and security fixes
Railwolf        Bug and security fixes
skuller         Platform definitions (platform.h, from Q2Pro)
WhiteFang       ZbotCheck, the basis of the aim jitter detection


Third-party code
----------------

tiny-json       by rafagafe, MIT License (src/g_json.c, src/g_json.h)
tiny-regex-c    by kokke, public domain (src/g_regex.c, src/g_regex.h)

Additions
---------

Apologies to any contributors missed above. Feel free to submit a pull request
adding yourself and a short description of your contribution.
